<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/20/eng@/~part_III__cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "A public authority which receives a request may defer access to the requested information if such information has been submitted for and is pending publication for any proceedings in Parliament or released to the media and shall inform the person reasons for the deferment and indicate, as far as practicable, the period of the deferment. Internal review"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/20/eng@> .
