<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/20/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The head of public authority may, after considering the appeal made under subsection (1) affirm, vary or set aside the decision of the public authority."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/20/eng@> .
